g noticeably flattened on the north side [1]. When standing in the supposed centre of Stannon Circle, a point between twenty-two and twenty-eight degrees north from east is marked by Rough Tor [1].\""}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:92563", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s001: period_name ''4500 - 3000 BC'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:92564", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s001: period_start ''-4500'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:142691", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-002: thumbnail_url ''https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/51/Stone_Circle_with_modern_china_clay_works._-_geograph.org.uk_-_418770.jpg'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/0a5920b9/hero.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:245657", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s001: period_name None -> ''4500 - 3000 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:245658", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s001: period_start None -> ''-4000''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:346290", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s001: period_name ''4500 - 3000 BC'' -> ''3000 - 1500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:346291", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s001: period_start ''-4000'' -> ''-2900''"}]'::jsonb),
    ('0ae727b3-6355-47ad-9c47-2c5f01a3bc20'::uuid, 'antiquity', '5', '10', 'card-stats-2026-11-07-rollback:0ae727b3-6355-47ad-9c47-2c5f01a3bc20:antiquity', 'rollback of card-stats-2026-11-07: antiquity ''10'' restored on Praileaitz Cave', '573e364c29b56dd2e28ed2690d111828', '[{"source": "api/cardgame/generator.py:site_card_stats", "url": "api/cardgame/generator.py", "quote": "antiquity = 5 from period_start None"}, {"source": "production export d17040beec27c2c0 (2026-11-07 10:00:39.847916+00)", "url": "remediation_change_log + unified_sites + card_stats (read-only)", "quote": "counterfactual: 900 journalled input value(s) put back reproduce the stored card_stats in all 59700 cells (basis: wave 2026-11-05''s own export (2026-11-05 22:52:16.465314+00))"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:81754", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "phase4:p4-2042:chunk-0001: description \"Praileaitz Cave (Basque: ''Rock of the Monk'') is a Paleolithic cave site in Deba, Gipuzkoa, Basque Country. In August 2006, non-figurative cave paintings were discovered during excavation, consisting of red dot groupings dated to the Lower Magdalenian period, approximately 15,500 years ago. The cave also yielded portable art on pebbles with abstract forms resembling Venus figurines found elsewhere in Paleolithic Europe. The adjacent Sasiola Quarry threatens conservation; a 50-meter protective zone was established by the Basque Government in 2007, though deemed insufficient by the Aranzadi Science Society.\" -> ''The Praileaitz Cave (Basque for Rock of the Monk cave) is located in the municipality of Deba (Gipuzkoa, Basque Country) [1]. Early in August 2006, various paleolithic cave paintings were found during an archaeological excavation - a non-figurative iconographic grouping made up of smaller groups of red dots, either isolated or forming a series [1]. Researchers have surmised that the paintings were created around 15,500 years ago [1]. The cave is located next to the Sasiola Quarry, which presents a threat to the conservation of the paintings [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:93237", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s002: period_name ''< 4500 BC'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:93238", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s002: period_start ''-13500'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:142722", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-002: thumbnail_url ''https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/67/Praileaitz.jpg'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/0ae727b3/hero.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:245665", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s001: period_name None -> ''< 4500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:245666", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s001: period_start None -> ''-10000''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:384964", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07_mechanical-period-fix-s001: period_name ''< 4500 BC'' -> ''Undated''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:384965", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07_mechanical-period-fix-s001: period_start ''-10000'' -> None"}]'::jsonb),
