The site slopes from approximately 90 to 95 metres in the west, with the summit of the unnamed hill approximately 500 metres to the southwest [1]. Close by to the south lies a Roman road heading into Calleva Atrebatum [1]. Also nearby, 500 metres to the west, lies a further smaller unidentified enclosure [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:93427", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s002: period_name ''1500 - 500 BC'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:93428", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s002: period_start ''-1000'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:143423", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-003: thumbnail_url ''https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/39/In_Benyon%27s_Inclosure_-_geograph.org.uk_-_2256055.jpg'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/1516a14a/hero.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:246105", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s002: period_name None -> ''1500 - 500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:246106", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s002: period_start None -> ''-800''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:384984", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07_mechanical-period-fix-s001: period_name ''1500 - 500 BC'' -> ''Undated''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:384985", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07_mechanical-period-fix-s001: period_start ''-800'' -> None"}]'::jsonb),
