 have served to irrigate cultivated fields, or as part of a water supply system for the town of Lacobriga, which was situated on Monte Molião, on the east bank of Ribeira of Bensafrim [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:114725", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26b_fields-wd1-s002: period_name ''1 - 500 AD'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:114726", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26b_fields-wd1-s002: period_start ''1'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:143907", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-004: thumbnail_url ''https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a4/Barragem_Romana_da_Fonte_Coberta.JPG'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/190fdea4/LagosBarragemDaFonteCoberta3.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:235490", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-02b_fields-wd3-s002: lat ''37.10294035182039'' -> ''37.110358''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:235491", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-02b_fields-wd3-s002: lon ''-8.672842176564192'' -> ''-8.690411''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:246467", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s003: period_name None -> ''500 BC - 1 AD''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:246468", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s003: period_start None -> ''-27''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:307701", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-05-002-002: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/190fdea4/LagosBarragemDaFonteCoberta3.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/190fdea4/Barragem_Romana_da_Fonte_Coberta.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:346390", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s001: period_name ''500 BC - 1 AD'' -> ''1 - 500 AD''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:346391", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s001: period_start ''-27'' -> ''43