, enclosing about 3.4 hectares [1]. The rampart is about 0.3–1.0 metre above the interior for most of its length, and about 6.5 metres above the external ditch [1]. There is a gap entrance in the south-east [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:94395", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s003: period_name ''1500 - 500 BC'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:94396", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s003: period_start ''-1000'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:246479", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s003: period_name None -> ''1500 - 500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:246480", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s003: period_start None -> ''-800''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:385008", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07_mechanical-period-fix-s001: period_name ''1500 - 500 BC'' -> ''Undated''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:385009", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07_mechanical-period-fix-s001: period_start ''-800'' -> None"}]'::jsonb),
