ar rampart, known locally as Schwedenschanze (Swedish rampart), are found on the hill [1]. They stretch for around 100 m, are 2 to 4 m high and reach a width of 12 m [1]. It is generally attributed to the Hallstatt period [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:114852", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26b_fields-wd1-s002: period_name ''1500 - 500 BC'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:114853", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26b_fields-wd1-s002: period_start ''-1500'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:114854", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26b_fields-wd1-s002: site_type ''Earthwork'' -> ''Fort''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:114855", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26b_fields-wd1-s002: source_url ''https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Schanzenkopf_(Schwedenschanze)'' -> ''https://www.alleburgen.de/bd.php?id=3126''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:144710", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-005: thumbnail_url ''https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/17/Schwedenschanze1.JPG'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/257ce429/Schwedenschanze Gipfelgrad Heidkopf.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:235631", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-02b_fields-wd3-s002: period_name None -> ''1500 - 500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:235632", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-02b_fields-wd3-s002: period_start None -> ''-800''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:308549", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-05-002-003: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/257ce429/Schwedenschanze Gipfelgrad Heidkopf.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/257ce429/Schwedenschanze1.webp''"}]'::jsonb),
