ch survives in places to a height of 4 metres, surrounded by a U-shaped ditch over 2 metres deep [1]. The outwork lies 100 metres to the east and is 17.8 metres wide and 0.4 metres high [1]. Remains found on the site suggest it was subject to an attack by the Romans, although the circumstances are unrecorded, and may simply reflect use of an abandoned site for training purposes [1]. Hawkesdown Camp was designated as a scheduled monument in 1924 [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:95365", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s004: period_name ''1500 - 500 BC'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:95366", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s004: period_start ''-1000'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:302104", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04a_fields-wd4-s001: period_name None -> ''1500 - 500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:302105", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04a_fields-wd4-s001: period_start None -> ''-800''"}]'::jsonb),
    ('291542d5-8a09-4599-bd7a-715f45e432a1'::uuid, 'antiquity', '6', '7', 'card-stats-2026-11-07-rollback:291542d5-8a09-4599-bd7a-715f45e432a1:antiquity', 'rollback of card-stats-2026-11-07: antiquity ''7'' restored on Massleberg 1 Rock Art', '02d1650bf33376dd394147a4d6a8f9fd', '[{"source": "api/cardgame/generator.py:site_card_stats", "url": "api/cardgame/generator.py", "quote": "antiquity = 6 from period_start -2000"}, {"source": "production export d17040beec27c2c0 (2026-11-07 10:00:39.847916+00)", "url": "remediation_change_log + unified_sites + card_stats (read-only)", "quote": "counterfactual: 900 journalled input value(s) put back reproduce the stored card_stats in all 59700 cells (basis: wave 2026-11-05''s own export (2026-11-05 22:52:16.465314+00))"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:80738", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "phase4:p4-2006:chunk-0001: description ''The Massleberg 1 rock carvings (RAA Skee 614:1) are located near Stromstad in Bohuslan, southwestern Sweden, about 80 metres from the Massleberg grave field. Dating to the Nordic Bronze Age (c. 1500-500 BC), the rock face displays partially overlapping carvings of ships, ithyphallic men bearing axes and spears, footprints, animals, cup marks, and a sun cross. A central hunting scene relates to the ships and footprints, possibly reflecting fertility rites with figures interpreted as gods transforming into animals. The site is part of a broader archaeological landscape including passage graves and barrow cemeteries.'' -> ''The Massleberg 1 rock art are located near Strömstad in Bohuslän, in south-western Sweden, some 80 metres from the Massleberg grave field [1]. On a rock face, several partially overlapping carvings from the Bronze Age can be seen [1]. Surrounded by numerous cup marks, the carvings depict Ithyphallic men, some bearing or raising axes, spears, and shields; Footprints; a lattice pattern; a sun cross; small and large ships; animals (deer and dogs), as well as various other images [1]. Small strokes in the rowing ship symbolise the crew members [1]. The \"hook\" on the ship image indicates a Lur [1]. The unusual image of a man carrying a ship is almost exactly the same as the depiction of shipbearer on another rock face in Bohuslän [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:95367", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s004: period_name ''4500 - 3000 BC'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:95368", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s004: period_start ''-4500'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:246951", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s004: period_name None -> ''< 4500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:246952", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s004: period_start None -> ''-10000''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:324983", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-06-005-001: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/291542d5/hero.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/291542d5/Strömstad Massleberg Skee 614-1 IMG 8921 ID 10159506140001.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:347239", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s002: period_name ''< 4500 BC'' -> ''3000 - 1500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:347240", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s002: period_start ''-10000'' -> ''-2500''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:385051", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07_mechanical-period-fix-s001: period_start ''-2500'' -> ''-2000''"}]'::jsonb),
