enes depict armed people hunting the guanaco and Andean religious symbols [1]. The scene depicted is of hunting by the humans who are corralling and killing a group of guanacos [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:145510", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-006: thumbnail_url ''https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/da/Toquepala_Caves_1.jpg'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/2b7bb7a9/Toquepala_Caves_1.webp''"}]'::jsonb),
