opolises of the Bronze and Iron Ages [1]. During the period of Islamic influence within the Iberian peninsula, the castro was reinforced to serve as an outpost [1]. The fortification controlled one of the principal routes of passage into the Algarve [1]. The plan of the castle consists of an irregular 125 metres-long polygon, with 60 metres width, consisting of 2.4 metres thick walls, although in some areas this width was between 5–6 metres [1]. These walls were reinforced by unequal-sized rectangular blocks [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:96336", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s005: period_name ''3000 - 1500 BC'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:96337", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s005: period_start ''-2000'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:145642", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-006: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/2d98b59c/hero.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/2d98b59c/Castro da Cola 02.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:247337", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s005: period_name None -> ''1000 - 1500 AD''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:247338", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s005: period_start None -> ''1000''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:308726", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-05-002-003: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/2d98b59c/Castro da Cola 02.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/2d98b59c/Castelo_da_Cola.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:357099", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-25p_fields-wd5-s002: period_name ''1000 - 1500 AD'' -> ''3000 - 1500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:357100", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-25p_fields-wd5-s002: period_start ''1000'' -> ''-2500''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:385068", "url": "remediation