a of about 6 hectares [1]. There are triple banks and ditches on the north-west side, and there are entrances in the north-east and south-west [1]. In an early phase, there was a smaller fort of 1.6 hectares at the south-west end, traces of the north-east rampart of this being visible in aerial photographs [1]. There is a straight bank and ditch across the interior, which was built at a late stage [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:97168", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s006: period_name ''1500 - 500 BC'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:97169", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s006: period_start ''-1500'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:236589", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-02b_fields-wd3-s003: period_name None -> ''1500 - 500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:236590", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-02b_fields-wd3-s003: period_start None -> ''-800''"}]'::jsonb),
