here is a fallen standing stone which has been built into a dry stone wall, and may have once formed a stone pair with the Longstone [1]. The area has numerous barrows and near the Longstone ornaments, flint and arrowheads have all been found [1]. The stone was believed to be able to cure infants of maladies such as measles and whooping cough, by passing the child through one of the natural holes [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:97227", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s006: period_name ''1500 - 500 BC'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:97228", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s006: period_start ''-1000'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:247781", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s006: period_name None -> ''4500 - 3000 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:247782", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s006: period_start None -> ''-4000''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:357141", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-25p_fields-wd5-s003: period_name ''4500 - 3000 BC'' -> ''3000 - 1500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:357142", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-25p_fields-wd5-s003: period_start ''-4000'' -> ''-1600''"}]'::jsonb),
    ('3963cd3e-5203-4506-a8a5-785aea857b71'::uuid, 'antiquity', '5', '8', 'card-stats-2026-11-07-rollback:3963cd3e-5203-4506-a8a5-785aea857b71:antiquity', 'rollback of card-stats-2026-11-07: antiquity ''8'' restored on Gamelands Stone Circle', '9283bba5ff277b51cb53ca9fb1b562ae', '[{"source": "api/cardgame/generator.py:site_card_stats", "url": "api/cardgame/generator.py", "quote": "antiquity = 5 from period_start None"}, {"source": "production export d17040beec27c2c0 (2026-11-07 10:00:39.847916+00)", "url": "remediation_change_log + unified_sites + card_stats (read-only)", "quote": "counterfactual: 900 journalled input value(s) put back reproduce the stored card_stats in all 59700 cells (basis: wave 2026-11-05''s own export (2026-11-05 22:52:16.465314+00))"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:80792", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "phase4:p4-2008:chunk-0001: description \"Prehistoric embanked stone circle at the foot of Knott Scar near Orton in Cumbria, England, dating from the Late Neolithic to Early Bronze Age (c. 2900-1600 BC). The largest stone circle in Cumbria, it forms a flattened oval approximately 45 by 38 metres with around 40 recumbent stones, all of local Shap pink granite except one of limestone. A community archaeology project identified remnants of the monument''s former bank and a palaeochannel running through the circle. It is the only complete example of an embanked stone circle in Cumbria and a designated Scheduled Monument.\" -> ''Gamelands stone circle (or Orton stone circle) is a stone circle at the foot of Knott Hill in Cumbria, England [1]. Gamelands stone circle lies between the village of Orton and the hamlet of Raisbeck [1]. It is an oval enclosure of around 40 large stones together with three smaller stones [1]. The stones are set into a slight bank [1]. The stones are all below one metre in height and are arranged in an oval of 42 metres by 35 metres [1]. Around 1862 some of the stones were buried or blasted [1]. Ploughing uncovered two worked flints and a probable cist-slab [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:97229", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s006: period_name ''4500 - 3000 BC'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:97230", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s006: period_start ''-4500'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:147069", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-008: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/3963cd3e/hero.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/3963cd3e/Gamelands stone circle 1.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:247783", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s006: period_name None -> ''4500 - 3000 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:247784", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s006: period_start None -> ''-4000''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:321378", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-06-004-001: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/3963cd3e/Gamelands stone circle 1.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/3963cd3e/hero.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:325002", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-06-005-001: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/3963cd3e/hero.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/3963cd3e/Gamelands stone circle 2.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:385103", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07_mechanical-period-fix-s001: period_name ''4500 - 3000 BC'' -> ''Undated''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:385104", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07_mechanical-period-fix-s001: period_start ''-4000'' -> None"}]'::jsonb),
