2 some of the stones were buried or blasted [1]. Ploughing uncovered two worked flints and a probable cist-slab [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:97229", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s006: period_name ''4500 - 3000 BC'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:97230", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s006: period_start ''-4500'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:147069", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-008: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/3963cd3e/hero.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/3963cd3e/Gamelands stone circle 1.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:247783", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s006: period_name None -> ''4500 - 3000 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:247784", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s006: period_start None -> ''-4000''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:321378", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-06-004-001: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/3963cd3e/Gamelands stone circle 1.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/3963cd3e/hero.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:325002", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-06-005-001: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/3963cd3e/hero.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/3963cd3e/Gamelands stone circle 2.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:385103", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07_mechanical-period-fix-s001: period_name ''4500 - 3000 BC'' -> ''Undated''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:385104", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07_mechanical-period-fix-s001: period_start ''-4000'' -> None"}]'::jsonb),
