th century and Owlaman''s Burrow in the 17th century, it received its current name in 1782 [1] [2]. It was scheduled as a protected monument in 1934 [1].\""}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:325006", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-06-005-001: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/3b348ad3/hero.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/3b348ad3/Aldermans Barrow (geograph 3359553).webp''"}]'::jsonb),
