ortant set is a frieze of dancers [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:116266", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26b_fields-wd1-s003: period_name ''500 BC - 1 AD'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:116267", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26b_fields-wd1-s003: period_start ''-500'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:247833", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s006: period_name None -> ''< 4500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:247834", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s006: period_start None -> ''-10000''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:309619", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-05-002-004: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/3e25aa3a/hero.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/3e25aa3a/AgrourAmogjar6.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:348130", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s003: period_name ''< 4500 BC'' -> ''Undated''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:348131", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s003: period_start ''-10000'' -> None"}]'::jsonb),
