ttle and human collective scenes [1]. The most important set is a frieze of dancers [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:116266", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26b_fields-wd1-s003: period_name ''500 BC - 1 AD'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:116267", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26b_fields-wd1-s003: period_start ''-500'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:247833", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s006: period_name None -> ''< 4500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:247834", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s006: period_start None -> ''-10000''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:309619", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-05-002-004: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/3e25aa3a/hero.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/3e25aa3a/AgrourAmogjar6.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:348130", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s003: period_name ''< 4500 BC'' -> ''Undated''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:348131", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s003: period_start ''-10000'' -> None"}]'::jsonb),
    ('3e27c892-40de-4be9-a3fd-396e17d3c86d'::uuid, 'mystery', '4', '5', 'card-stats-2026-11-07-rollback:3e27c892-40de-4be9-a3fd-396e17d3c86d:mystery', 'rollback of card-stats-2026-11-07: mystery ''5'' restored on Buddhist Caves of Khapra Kodiya', 'fc66dcd7959978889c3e43030cb7e222', '[{"source": "api/cardgame/generator.py:site_card_stats", "url": "api/cardgame/generator.py", "quote": "mystery = 4 from (''Cave Structures'', ''Undated'') is shared by 52 curated site(s)"}, {"source": "production export d17040beec27c2c0 (2026-11-07 10:00:39.847916+00)", "url": "remediation_change_log + unified_sites + card_stats (read-only)", "quote": "counterfactual: 900 journalled input value(s) put back reproduce the stored card_stats in all 59700 cells (basis: wave 2026-11-05''s own export (2026-11-05 22:52:16.465314+00))"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:83312", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "phase4:p4-2076:chunk-0001: description ''The Khapra Kodiya Caves, part of the Junagadh Buddhist Cave Group in Gujarat, are the oldest caves in the cluster, dating to the 3rd-4th century BCE based on ancient scribbles and cursive letters on the walls[1]. Carved during the reign of Emperor Ashoka, they represent the earliest monastic settlement in the region[1]. These plain caves, also known as Khangar Mahal, lie along the edge of the ancient Sudarshan Lake, just north of Uparkot fort[1].'' -> \"The Khapra Kodiya Caves are part of the Junagadh Buddhist Cave Group [1]. They are the oldest of the caves in the group [1]. The caves, on the basis of scribbles and short cursive letters on the wall, are dated to 3rd-4th century BCE during the Emperor Ashoka''s rule and are the plainest of all the caves in the groups [1]. These caves are also known as Khangar Mahal [1]. They were carved in rock during the reign of Emperor Ashoka and are considered the earliest monastic settlement in the area [1]. These caves are along the edge of the ancient Sudarshan Lake (which no longer exists) and a little outside Uparkot fort, to the north [1]. The caves are carved out in an east–west longitudinal ridge [1]. Khapara Kodia was damaged by later quarrying, and now only the highest story remains [1].\""}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:97313", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s006: period_name ''500 BC - 1 AD'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:97314", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s006: period_start ''-500'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:147743", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-009: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/3e27c892/hero.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/3e27c892/Khapara_Kodiya_Caves_-_Under_Ground_Room_with_Stairs.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:236671", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-02b_fields-wd3-s003: period_name None -> ''500 BC - 1 AD''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:236672", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-02b_fields-wd3-s003: period_start None -> ''-300''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:309622", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-05-002-004: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/3e27c892/Khapara_Kodiya_Caves_-_Under_Ground_Room_with_Stairs.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/3e27c892/Khapara_Kodiya_Caves_-_Frontside.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:348132", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s003: period_name ''500 BC - 1 AD'' -> ''Undated''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:348133", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s003: period_start ''-300'' -> None"}]'::jsonb),
