 oldest paintings are circa 6,600 years old [1]. The most common themes in Saraakallio paintings are deer, human, and boat figures [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:98167", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s007: period_name ''4500 - 3000 BC'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:98168", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s007: period_start ''-4500'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:149408", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-011: thumbnail_url ''https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/3d/Laukaa_-_rock_painting2.jpg'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/4d0928dd/Kalliomaalaukset Saraakalliolla.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:237568", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-02b_fields-wd3-s004: period_name None -> ''< 4500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:237569", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-02b_fields-wd3-s004: period_start None -> ''-5000''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:310451", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-05-002-005: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/4d0928dd/Kalliomaalaukset Saraakalliolla.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/4d0928dd/Laukaa_-_rock_painting2.webp''"}]'::jsonb),
    ('4d0fa83d-8685-49ee-ba7d-27d9f256e303'::uuid, 'mystery', '5', '4', 'card-stats-2026-11-07-rollback:4d0fa83d-8685-49ee-ba7d-27d9f256e303:mystery', 'rollback of card-stats-2026-11-07: mystery ''4'' restored on Craig Rhiwarth', '8fe961f002b9d197adeb7a20842ff4aa', '[{"source": "api/cardgame/generator.py:site_card_stats", "url": "api/cardgame/generator.py", "quote": "mystery = 5 from (''Fort'', ''1500 - 500 BC'') is shared by 28 curated site(s)"}, {"source": "production export d17040beec27c2c0 (2026-11-07 10:00:39.847916+00)", "url": "remediation_change_log + unified_sites + card_stats (read-only)", "quote": "counterfactual: 900 journalled input value(s) put back reproduce the stored card_stats in all 59700 cells (basis: wave 2026-11-05''s own export (2026-11-05 22:52:16.465314+00))"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:83772", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "phase4:p4-2085:chunk-0001: description ''Craig Rhiwarth is an Iron Age hillfort on a mountain in the Berwyn range, Powys, Wales, overlooking the village of Llangynog [1]. There are remains of slate quarrying visible on the southern slopes [1].'' -> ''Craig Rhiwarth is a mountain in the Berwyn range, in Powys (formerly Montgomeryshire), Wales [1]. On the summit is an Iron Age hillfort [1]. The altitude of Craig Rhiwarth is 532 metres; the hillfort is one of the highest in Wales [1]. The size of the enclosure is about 850 metres east to west by 400–500 metres [1]. The site has precipitous slopes on all sides except the north: on this side there is a ruinous stone wall above a scarp [1]. There is a simple entrance near the centre of the wall and a slanting entrance at the west end [1]. Within this area are the foundations of about 170 circular stone structures, of diameter 4–12 metres [1]. It is thought that the settlement may have begun in the late Bronze Age and continued into the Iron Age, and that its function probably ceased by the time of the Roman conquest in the 1st century A.D. There are also a few rectangular hafodydd, probably of medieval date, relating to seasonal settlement [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:116424", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26b_fields-wd1-s003: period_name ''1500 - 500 BC'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:116425", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26b_fields-wd1-s003: period_start ''-1500'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:116426", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26b_fields-wd1-s003: site_type ''Fortress/citadel'' -> ''Fort''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:237570", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-02b_fields-wd3-s004: period_name None -> ''1500 - 500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:237571", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-02b_fields-wd3-s004: period_start None -> ''-800''"}]'::jsonb),
