is the second largest in Portugal [1]. Based on its similarity to other megalithic finds in the Évora district, the menhir is believed to date from the Late Neolithic or Chalcolithic [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:149569", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-011: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/53325d71/hero.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/53325d71/OuteiroMenhir1.webp''"}]'::jsonb),
