nsumed by fire from heaven\", so the legend goes [1]. There are the remains of strong ramparts on all sides, with an entrance at the west end [1]. In the south-west quarter of the fort enclosure are about two dozen hut platforms; there is a spring close to the centre [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:117636", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26b_fields-wd1-s004: period_name ''3000 - 1500 BC'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:117637", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26b_fields-wd1-s004: period_start ''-3000'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:117638", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26b_fields-wd1-s004: site_type ''Fortress/citadel'' -> ''Fort''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:117639", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26b_fields-wd1-s004: source_url ''https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Foel_Fenlli'' -> ''https://coflein.gov.uk/en/sites/96522''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:150288", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-012: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/58b67d2b/hero.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/58b67d2b/Moel Fenlli, yn y bore bach, yng Ngorffennaf 2024 - early morning drone image of Moel Fenlli, Clwydian Hills, in the country of Wales 22.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:248741", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s008: period_name None -> ''1500 - 500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:248742", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s008: period_start None -> ''-800''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:311209", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-05-002-006: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/58b67d2b/Moel Fenlli, yn y bore bach, yng Ngorffennaf 2024 - early morning drone image of Moel Fenlli, Clwydian Hills, in the country of Wales 22.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/58b67d2b/Stone_cairn_at_the_summit_of_Foel_Fenli