 the hillfort area there are remains of abandoned quarries for building stone [1]. A small church stood for some time at Slwch Tump, marking the place where Saint Eluned was supposedly beheaded [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:99936", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s009: period_name ''1500 - 500 BC'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:99937", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s009: period_start ''-1500'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:150332", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-012: thumbnail_url ''https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/5d/Slwch_Tump_-_geograph.org.uk_-_344523.jpg/400px-Slwch_Tump_-_geograph.org.uk_-_344523.jpg'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/5a5beef1/hero.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:248759", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s008: period_name None -> ''1500 - 500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:248760", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s008: period_start None -> ''-800''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:385784", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07_mechanical-period-fix-s002: period_name ''1500 - 500 BC'' -> ''Undated''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:385785", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07_mechanical-period-fix-s002: period_start ''-800'' -> None"}]'::jsonb),
