ed to date from the 2nd to the 4th centuries [1].\""}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:100012", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s009: period_name ''1 - 500 AD'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:100013", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s009: period_start ''1'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:150948", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-013: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/5d5061d0/hero.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/5d5061d0/On the summit of Mynydd Twr (Holyhead Mountain), Wales, where lies a wonderful Celtic fort 04.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:248801", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s008: period_name None -> ''1500 - 500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:248802", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s008: period_start None -> ''-800''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:311315", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-05-002-006: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/5d5061d0/On the summit of Mynydd Twr (Holyhead Mountain), Wales, where lies a wonderful Celtic fort 04.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/5d5061d0/Caerytwr.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:385798", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07_mechanical-period-fix-s002: period_name ''1500 - 500 BC'' -> ''Undated''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:385799", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07_mechanical-period-fix-s002: period_start ''-800'' -> None"}]'::jsonb),
