 of Black Mountain are the ruins of an ancient Hohokam fortification [1]. Long stone walls, circular stone rings, petroglyphs, man-made trails, and pottery sherds can still be seen today [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:117711", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26b_fields-wd1-s004: period_name ''1 - 500 AD'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:117712", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26b_fields-wd1-s004: period_start ''1'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:117713", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26b_fields-wd1-s004: site_type ''Fortress/citadel'' -> ''Fortification''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:151017", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-013: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/5e7bedef/hero.webp'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:249173", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s009: period_name None -> ''1500 - 500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:249174", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s009: period_start None -> ''-800''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:333874", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-06-009-001: thumbnail_url None -> ''/data/images/wiki/5e7bedef/hero.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:349084", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s004: period_name ''1500 - 500 BC'' -> ''Undated''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:349085", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s004: period_start ''-800'' -> None"}]'::jsonb),
