ing and one fallen, and at some time in the next hundred years a Cornish hedge was constructed through the circle [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:100839", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s010: period_name ''4500 - 3000 BC'' -> ''3000 - 1500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:100840", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s010: period_start ''-4500'' -> ''-2400''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:151740", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-014: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/66b6fcb0/hero.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/66b6fcb0/Boscawen-Un (01).webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:312087", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-05-002-007: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/66b6fcb0/Boscawen-Un (01).webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/66b6fcb0/Boscawen-Un_stone_circle_2011.webp''"}]'::jsonb),
