    ('6cc8d849-0080-41c6-8082-b713db44f82b'::uuid, 'mystery', '2', '1', 'card-stats-2026-11-07-rollback:6cc8d849-0080-41c6-8082-b713db44f82b:mystery', 'rollback of card-stats-2026-11-07: mystery ''1'' restored on Giant''s Castle, Isles of Scilly', '8dc108e68eb1d2638016598e1133768f', '[{"source": "api/cardgame/generator.py:site_card_stats", "url": "api/cardgame/generator.py", "quote": "mystery = 2 from (''Fortress/citadel'', ''Undated'') is shared by 187 curated site(s)"}, {"source": "production export d17040beec27c2c0 (2026-11-07 10:00:39.847916+00)", "url": "remediation_change_log + unified_sites + card_stats (read-only)", "quote": "counterfactual: 900 journalled input value(s) put back reproduce the stored card_stats in all 59700 cells (basis: wave 2026-11-05''s own export (2026-11-05 22:52:16.465314+00))"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:85152", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "phase4:p4-2106:chunk-0001: description \"Giant''s Castle is an Iron Age cliff castle on St Mary''s, Isles of Scilly, occupying a 0.4-hectare rocky promontory defended by sea cliffs 15-25 metres high. The landward side features three concentric banks and ditches protecting a small interior area of roughly 25m by 20m. Pottery sherds confirm its use as a high-status enclosure, possibly for economic or social purposes during approximately 800-43 BC. The site sustained damage during WWII from machine gun practice targeting.\" -> \"The Giant''s Castle is a promontory fort of the Iron Age, on St Mary''s, Isles of Scilly [1]. It is a scheduled monument [1]. The fort is situated in the south-east of St Mary''s [1]. The rocky promontory, area 0.4 hectares, is defended by sea cliffs, 15 to 25 metres high, on the east, south and south-west sides [1]. To the north there are three banks and ditches, 8 to 12 metres apart; these occupy most of the steep northern slope linking the promontory to the mainland [1]. The castle, on almost level ground within the promontory, has an internal area of