measures 19.57 m long by 8.4 m wide, with a height of 19.21 m [1].\""}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:152324", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-015: thumbnail_url ''https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/62/Orange_-_Arc_de_triomphe_romain_1.JPG'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/6d2ffc46/01 Triumphal Arch of Orange.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:312196", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-05-002-007: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/6d2ffc46/01 Triumphal Arch of Orange.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/6d2ffc46/Orange_-_Arc_de_triomphe_romain_1.webp''"}]'::jsonb),
