th Somerset Levels, next to the Limebreach Wood ancient woodland and nature reserve [1]. The hill fort was constructed during the Iron Age, probably by the local Dobunni tribe, however the details are not fully known [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:152984", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-016: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/749c6264/hero.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/749c6264/Cadbury Camp.webp''"}]'::jsonb),
