ular note are Goosehill Camp, an Iron Age hillfort about 1,500 metres north-northeast of Bow Hill on the east side of the ridge, and the Devil''s Humps, a cluster of four Bronze Age barrows [1].\""}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:119026", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26b_fields-wd1-s005: period_name ''4500 - 3000 BC'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:119027", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26b_fields-wd1-s005: period_start ''-4500'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:119028", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26b_fields-wd1-s005: site_type ''Mound/tumulus'' -> ''Barrow''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:119029", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26b_fields-wd1-s005: source_url ''https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bow_Hill,_Sussex'' -> ''https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bow_Hill,_West_Sussex''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:250113", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s011: period_name None -> ''4500 - 3000 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:250114", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s011: period_start None -> ''-4000''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:349970", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s005: period_name ''4500 - 3000 BC'' -> ''Undated''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:349971", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s005: period_start ''-4000'' -> None"}]'::jsonb),
