ds-wd1-s011: period_name ''500 BC - 1 AD'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:101772", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s011: period_start ''-500'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:153120", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-016: thumbnail_url ''https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/68/Zemun_panoramic_view.jpg/400px-Zemun_panoramic_view.jpg'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/775adc1b/Zemun_View_3.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:238702", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-02b_fields-wd3-s005: period_name None -> ''500 BC - 1 AD''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:238703", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-02b_fields-wd3-s005: period_start None -> ''-300''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:349972", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s005: period_name ''500 BC - 1 AD'' -> ''4500 - 3000 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:349973", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s005: period_start ''-300'' -> ''-4000''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:385882", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07_mechanical-period-fix-s002: period_name ''4500 - 3000 BC'' -> ''< 4500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:385883", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07_mechanical-period-fix-s002: period_start ''-4000'' -> ''-6200''"}]'::jsonb),
    ('7793574e-f857-4526-bfc4-d9a64281f303'::uuid, 'antiquity', '5', '7', 'card-stats-2026-11-07-rollback:7793574e-f857-4526-bfc4-d9a64281f303:antiquity', 'rollback of card-stats-2026-11-07: antiquity ''7'' restored on Ringmoor Stone Row and Cairn Circle', '1dd039ffafafbff032af1e09e6859c80', '[{"source": "api/cardgame/generator.py:site_card_stats", "url": "api/cardgame/generator.py", "quote": "antiquity = 5 from period_start None"}, {"source": "production export d17040beec27c2c0 (2026-11-07 10:00:39.847916+00)", "url": "remediation_change_log + unified_sites + card_stats (read-only)", "quote": "counterfactual: 900 journalled input value(s) put back reproduce the stored card_stats in all 59700 cells (basis: wave 2026-11-05''s own export (2026-11-05 22:52:16.465314+00))"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:85448", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "phase4:p4-2114:chunk-0001: description ''A Bronze Age stone row and cairn circle on Ringmoor Down in Dartmoor, Devon, part of the Upper Plym Valley archaeological landscape. The stone row extends 356 metres, mainly single but double in parts, terminating at a standing stone to the north. At its southern end lies a cairn circle 12.6 metres in diameter enclosing a burial cairn 9.5 metres wide. Many original stones were robbed for reuse; a controversial 1909 restoration by Baring-Gould included importing stones from up to half a kilometre away. Located 300 metres north of Brisworthy stone circle.'' -> ''Ringmoor stone row and cairn circle is a prehistoric stone row and cairn circle on Ringmoor Down in Devon [1]. It is located three miles east of the A386, northeast of the village of Shaugh Prior [1]. It is three hundred metres north from Brisworthy stone circle, and is one of the archaeological sites found in the Upper Plym Valley [1]. The stone row is 356 metres long [1]. It is mainly single, but is double in parts [1]. At the southern end is a cairn circle with a diameter of 12.6 metres [1]. The central cairn is 9.5 metres in diameter and has a height of 0.4 metres [1]. A standing stone terminates the stone row at the northern end [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:101780", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s011: period_name ''4500 - 3000 BC'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:101781", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s011: period_start ''-4000'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:153129", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-016: thumbnail_url ''https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/ca/Ringmoor_Down_Circle.jpg'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/7793574e/hero.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:250117", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s011: period_name None -> ''4500 - 3000 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:250118", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s011: period_start None -> ''-4000''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:349976", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s005: period_name ''4500 - 3000 BC'' -> ''3000 - 1500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:349977", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s005: period_start ''-4000'' -> ''-2500''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:385884", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07_mechanical-period-fix-s002: period_name ''3000 - 1500 BC'' -> ''Undated''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:385885", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07_mechanical-period-fix-s002: period_start ''-2500'' -> None"}]'::jsonb),
