tion_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-016: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/782afd80/hero.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/782afd80/County Tyrone - Beaghmore Stone Circles, Cairns and Alignments 20230303 cairn between circles C and D.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:313000", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-05-002-008: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/782afd80/County Tyrone - Beaghmore Stone Circles, Cairns and Alignments 20230303 cairn between circles C and D.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/782afd80/A_stone_circle_at_Beaghmore..webp''"}]'::jsonb),
