criptions were engraved - three in Latin and one in Greek, describing the ritual celebrated [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:119045", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26b_fields-wd1-s005: site_type ''Cave Structures'' -> ''Sanctuary''"}]'::jsonb),
