covered [1]. The chamber is reached from outside by a 14 m-long corridor or passage [1]. Of the 29 orthostat slabs that form the sides of the passage, 23 are decorated with carved symbols and patterns [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:120179", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26b_fields-wd1-s006: site_type ''Necropolis/tombs complex'' -> ''Cairn''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:120180", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26b_fields-wd1-s006: source_url ''https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gavrinis'' -> ''https://fr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cairn_de_Gavrinis''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:153875", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-017: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/7ceced42/hero.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/7ceced42/Cairn de Gavrinis par drone - vue 1.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:313080", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-05-002-008: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/7ceced42/Cairn de Gavrinis par drone - vue 1.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/7ceced42/Cairn_Gavrinis_entrance.webp''"}]'::jsonb),
