layers were identified at the site [1]. Indices of the Mousterian culture were found in between the 2nd and 6th layer [1]. The remains of large mammals such as horse, noble deer, bull were found in the 5th layer [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:102525", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s012: period_name ''500 BC - 1 AD'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:102526", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s012: period_start ''-500'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:153891", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-017: thumbnail_url ''https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e6/Çaxmaqdaşı_və_dəvəgözündən_əmək_alətləri.JPG/400px-Çaxmaqdaşı_və_dəvəgözündən_əmək_alətləri.JPG'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/7d8df981/hero.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:250177", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s011: period_name None -> ''< 4500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:250178", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s011: period_start None -> ''-3000000''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:385904", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07_mechanical-period-fix-s002: period_name ''< 4500 BC'' -> ''Undated''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:385905", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07_mechanical-period-fix-s002: period_start ''-3000000'' -> None"}]'::jsonb),
