eze and cornice [1]. The monument was erected in the reign of Augustus, around 13 BC [1]. It was later restored at the beginning of the 2nd century AD pursuant to terms of the will of Lucius Licinius Sura [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:154561", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-018: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/82f23c96/hero.webp'' -> \"/data/images/wiki/82f23c96/38 Representació de l''Arc de Berà, a la plaça de l''Ajuntament (Roda de Berà).webp\""}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:334565", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-06-009-002: thumbnail_url \"/data/images/wiki/82f23c96/38 Representació de l''Arc de Berà, a la plaça de l''Ajuntament (Roda de Berà).webp\" -> ''/data/images/wiki/82f23c96/hero.webp''"}]'::jsonb),
