 park in the county of Hampshire [1]. The site lies on a small hill of 92m AOD [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:103511", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s013: period_name ''1500 - 500 BC'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:103512", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s013: period_start ''-1000'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:251069", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s013: period_name None -> ''1500 - 500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:251070", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s013: period_start None -> ''-800''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:386567", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07_mechanical-period-fix-s003: period_name ''1500 - 500 BC'' -> ''Undated''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:386568", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07_mechanical-period-fix-s003: period_start ''-800'' -> None"}]'::jsonb),
