closure [1]. There are two opposed inturned entrances on the east and west sides; the eastern entrance is clearly defined, the western entrance less so [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:104201", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s014: period_name ''1500 - 500 BC'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:104202", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s014: period_start ''-1000'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:251099", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s013: period_name None -> ''1500 - 500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:251100", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s013: period_start None -> ''-800''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:314035", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-05-002-009: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/93d28b0d/hero.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/93d28b0d/Cadson Bury Fort - geograph.org.uk - 411641.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:386583", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07_mechanical-period-fix-s003: period_name ''1500 - 500 BC'' -> ''Undated''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:386584", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07_mechanical-period-fix-s003: period_start ''-800'' -> None"}]'::jsonb),
