g children''s toys, weapons, icons, and pharmacological devices [1]. Within the first two months of digging, archaeologists had excavated over 35,000 pieces from hundreds of graves and ruins of settlements that date back to the eighth century BCE [1].\""}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:104246", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s014: period_name ''1500 - 500 BC'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:104247", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s014: period_start ''-1500'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:156681", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-021: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/9737ca03/hero.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/9737ca03/Grakliani Gora archaeological site, Kaspi Municipality, Georgia 11.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:251127", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s013: period_name None -> ''1 - 500 AD''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:251128", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s013: period_start None -> ''43''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:334618", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-06-009-002: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/9737ca03/Grakliani Gora archaeological site, Kaspi Municipality, Georgia 11.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/9737ca03/Grakliani_Script_(IX-X_century_B.D.).webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:357269", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-25p_fields-wd5-s006: period_name ''1 - 500 AD'' -> ''4500 - 3000 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:357270", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-25p_fields-wd5-s006: period_start ''43'' -> ''-4500''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:386595", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07_mechanical-period-fix-s003: period_name ''4500 - 3000 BC'' -> ''Undated''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:386596", "ur