1]. The south west side of the hill was quarried significantly in the 19th century [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:121537", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26b_fields-wd1-s007: period_name ''1500 - 500 BC'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:121538", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26b_fields-wd1-s007: period_start ''-1000'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:121539", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26b_fields-wd1-s007: site_type ''Fortress/citadel'' -> ''Fort''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:121540", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26b_fields-wd1-s007: source_url ''https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cley_Hill'' -> ''https://heritagerecords.nationaltrust.org.uk/HBSMR/MonRecord.aspx?uid=MNA138235''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:156709", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-021: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/98e72c8a/hero.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/98e72c8a/Cley_Hill_Digital_Terrain_Model.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:251135", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s013: period_name None -> ''1500 - 500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:251136", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s013: period_start None -> ''-800''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:334624", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-06-009-002: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/98e72c8a/Cley_Hill_Digital_Terrain_Model.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/98e72c8a/hero.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:386599", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07_mechanical-period-fix-s003: period_name ''1500 - 500 BC'' -> ''Undated''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:386600", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07_mechanical-period-fix-s003: period_start ''-800'' -> None"}]'::jsonb),
