 for figures have been chiselled into the rock, each surrounded by holes [1]. Today, the cross is about 3.5 metres high [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:104343", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s014: period_name ''4500 - 3000 BC'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:104344", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s014: period_start ''-4500'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:156857", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-021: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/9bedafde/hero.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/9bedafde/Fraubillenkreuz ferschweiler plateau eifel 2.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:240707", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-02b_fields-wd3-s007: period_name None -> ''3000 - 1500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:240708", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-02b_fields-wd3-s007: period_start None -> ''-3000''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:334642", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-06-009-002: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/9bedafde/Fraubillenkreuz ferschweiler plateau eifel 2.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/9bedafde/hero.webp''"}]'::jsonb),
