north and somewhat out of line with the other three [1]. The total arrangement is spread over roughly 1.2 km [1]. The four circles each consist of a flat circular area surrounded by a bank and external ditch enclosure with more than one entrance [1].\""}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:157589", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-022: thumbnail_url ''https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/1a/Priddy_circles.jpg'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/a1435e3d/Priddy_circles.webp''"}]'::jsonb),
