 hill, 159 metres above sea level [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:105237", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s015: period_name ''1500 - 500 BC'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:105238", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s015: period_start ''-1000'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:158411", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-023: thumbnail_url ''https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/e1/Exeter_District_-_Stoke_Hill_Farm_Track_%28geograph_3417475%29.jpg'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:251935", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s015: period_name None -> ''1500 - 500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:251936", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s015: period_start None -> ''-800''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:323575", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-06-004-002: thumbnail_url None -> ''/data/images/wiki/aa60e5f1/hero.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:325331", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-06-005-002: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/aa60e5f1/hero.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/aa60e5f1/Exeter District - Stoke Hill Farm Track (geograph 3417475).webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:386653", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07_mechanical-period-fix-s003: period_name ''1500 - 500 BC'' -> ''Undated''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:386654", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07_mechanical-period-fix-s003: period_start ''-800'' -> None"}]'::jsonb),
