of which have been moved and are now used as gates [1]. The stone row at Carrigagulla SW is built from three stones, one of which has fallen [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:122992", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26b_fields-wd1-s008: period_name ''4500 - 3000 BC'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:122993", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26b_fields-wd1-s008: period_start ''-4000'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:160066", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-025: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/b97f1e4c/hero.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/b97f1e4c/Carrigagulla 0509.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:252429", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s016: period_name None -> ''4500 - 3000 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:252430", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s016: period_start None -> ''-4000''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:334720", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-06-009-002: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/b97f1e4c/Carrigagulla 0509.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/b97f1e4c/hero.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:351910", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s007: period_name ''4500 - 3000 BC'' -> ''Undated''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:351911", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s007: period_start ''-4000'' -> None"}]'::jsonb),
