t measuring 2 meters by almost 1 meter [1]. Human remains were found along with grave goods including the Rillaton Gold Cup, a bronze dagger, beads, pottery, glass and other items [1]. Most notably, the burial contained the Rillaton Gold Cup, a biconical gold vessel, around 9 cm high, with a handle attached with rivets [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:106944", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s017: period_name ''4500 - 3000 BC'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:106945", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s017: period_start ''-4500'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:160676", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-026: thumbnail_url ''https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/ac/Blocked_up_entrance_to_Rillaton_Barrow.JPG'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/bc55dd6f/Blocked_up_entrance_to_Rillaton_Barrow.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:252781", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s017: period_name None -> ''4500 - 3000 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:252782", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s017: period_start None -> ''-4000''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:351922", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s007: period_name ''4500 - 3000 BC'' -> ''3000 - 1500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:351923", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s007: period_start ''-4000'' -> ''-2500''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:387320", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07_mechanical-period-fix-s004: period_name ''3000 - 1500 BC'' -> ''Undated''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:387321", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07_mechanical-period-fix-s004: period_start ''-2500'' -> None"}]'::jsonb),
