the second major exploration of the caves and between 1945 and 1947, the archaeologist, Abreu Nunes, carried out new excavations that discovered different funerary remains, including: polished and chipped stone artefacts; limestone votive offerings, such as cylindrical idols; decorated schist slabs, and ceramics [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:107006", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s017: period_name ''4500 - 3000 BC'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:107007", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s017: period_start ''-4000'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:242707", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-02b_fields-wd3-s009: period_name None -> ''4500 - 3000 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:242708", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-02b_fields-wd3-s009: period_start None -> ''-4000''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:352721", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s008: period_name ''4500 - 3000 BC'' -> ''< 4500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:352722", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s008: period_start ''-4000'' -> ''-3000000''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:387332", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07_mechanical-period-fix-s004: period_name ''< 4500 BC'' -> ''Undated''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:387333", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07_mechanical-period-fix-s004: period_start ''-3000000'' -> None"}]'::jsonb),
