carried out [1]. The excavation showed that the stone stood in a setting of quartz pebbles below which were two small hollows [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:161416", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-027: thumbnail_url ''https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/33/SaintBreockDownsLongstone_ancientAndModern.jpg'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/c34bf073/St Breock Downs Monolith.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:316712", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-05-002-012: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/c34bf073/St Breock Downs Monolith.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/c34bf073/SaintBreockDownsLongstone_ancientAndModern.webp''"}]'::jsonb),
