d a settlement, although there is a possibility that the hillfort was to be constructed over an earlier unenclosed settlement [1]. Apart from the dumps of material associated with the abandoned construction works, the interior has very few other earthworks of intelligible character [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:124182", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26b_fields-wd1-s009: period_name ''1500 - 500 BC'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:124183", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26b_fields-wd1-s009: period_start ''-1500'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:124184", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26b_fields-wd1-s009: site_type ''Fortress/citadel'' -> ''Fort''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:253201", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s018: period_name None -> ''1500 - 500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:253202", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s018: period_start None -> ''-800''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:387366", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07_mechanical-period-fix-s004: period_name ''1500 - 500 BC'' -> ''Undated''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:387367", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07_mechanical-period-fix-s004: period_start ''-800'' -> None"}]'::jsonb),
