]. A remarkable example is the ornament known as The Sorcerer, which is described as a horned and bearded man-like figure with a foot and leg which resembles the one of a human [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:109679", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s020: period_name ''500 BC - 1 AD'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:109680", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s020: period_start ''-500'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:163703", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-030: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/d7e1cd9a/hero.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/d7e1cd9a/Crocuta crocuta cave art - Le Gabillou cave.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:253693", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s019: period_name None -> ''500 BC - 1 AD''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:253694", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s019: period_start None -> ''-500''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:352908", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s008: period_name ''500 BC - 1 AD'' -> ''< 4500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:352909", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s008: period_start ''-500'' -> ''-3000000''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:387414", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07_mechanical-period-fix-s004: period_name ''< 4500 BC'' -> ''Undated''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:387415", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07_mechanical-period-fix-s004: period_start ''-3000000'' -> None"}]'::jsonb),
