rney, passes the hamlet of Villeronde [1]. Only a portion of the aqueduct-bridge is now visible as it passes through the \"Valley of the Arennes\" [1]. The remains of the aqueduct-bridge are located 1.5 km northeast of the centre of Luynes [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:110649", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s021: period_name ''1 - 500 AD'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:110650", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s021: period_start ''1'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:165140", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-032: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/e7fe6e06/hero.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/e7fe6e06/Aqueduc_Luynes.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:254581", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s021: period_name None -> ''1 - 500 AD''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:254582", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s021: period_start None -> ''43''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:387460", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07_mechanical-period-fix-s004: period_name ''1 - 500 AD'' -> ''Undated''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:387461", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07_mechanical-period-fix-s004: period_start ''43'' -> None"}]'::jsonb),
