 moat and a large main rampart [1]. Even today, the top of the main rampart is up to 12 meters above the bottom of the moat [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:111354", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s022: period_name ''1500 - 500 BC'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:111355", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s022: period_start ''-1500'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:165255", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-032: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/eaeff16a/hero.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/eaeff16a/Alte_Burg_Langenenslingen-8145.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:244708", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-02b_fields-wd3-s011: period_name None -> ''1500 - 500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:244709", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-02b_fields-wd3-s011: period_start None -> ''-700''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:319276", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-05-002-015: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/eaeff16a/Alte_Burg_Langenenslingen-8145.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/eaeff16a/Alte_Burg_Langenenslingen-8170.webp''"}]'::jsonb),
