iod right up to Late Antiquity [1]. The excavation site at the villa confirms the presence of a thriving olive oil industry on the southern end of the islands [1]. The remains rest on the highest point of a long, flat ridge stretching in an east-west direction [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:111381", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s022: period_name ''500 BC - 1 AD'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:111382", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s022: period_start ''-500'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:165751", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-033: thumbnail_url ''https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/08/Zejtun_Roman_Villa_(12682983103).jpg/400px-Zejtun_Roman_Villa_(12682983103).jpg'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/ebf816e0/hero.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:254625", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s021: period_name None -> ''1 - 500 AD''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:254626", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s021: period_start None -> ''43''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:353825", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s009: period_name ''1 - 500 AD'' -> ''Undated''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:353826", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s009: period_start ''43'' -> None"}]'::jsonb),
