uled monument due to its importance as an archaeological site [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:111510", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s022: period_name ''3000 - 1500 BC'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:111511", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s022: period_start ''-2000'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:254679", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s021: period_name None -> ''1500 - 500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:254680", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s021: period_start None -> ''-800''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:387484", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07_mechanical-period-fix-s004: period_name ''1500 - 500 BC'' -> ''Undated''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:387485", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07_mechanical-period-fix-s004: period_start ''-800'' -> None"}]'::jsonb),
