 height of about 3,474 metres [1]. The site with 6 m to 8 m high rectangular stone structures is surrounded by an 8 m to 10 m high wall [1]. Some of the stony walls are covered with petroglyphs showing spiral figures and human faces [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:165976", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-033: thumbnail_url ''https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/ba/Cruzpampa_00218.jpg'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/f2da07c6/hero.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:255009", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s022: period_name None -> ''1500 - 500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:255010", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s022: period_start None -> ''-800''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:326468", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-06-005-003: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/f2da07c6/hero.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/f2da07c6/Cruzpampa 00218.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:354402", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s010: lat ''-9.283089759415377'' -> ''-9.276667''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:354403", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s010: lon ''-76.73330111787394'' -> ''-76.725581''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:354404", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s010: period_name ''1500 - 500 BC'' -> ''Undated''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:354405", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s010: period_start ''-800'' -> None"}]'::jsonb),
