a site had an unexcavated southern part that lies 700 metres northwest of Kition\\''s city wall, and 1,500 metres northwest of the seashore [1]. \"The site had been used as a cemetery from the beginning of the Iron Age until the Roman times\" [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:111546", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s022: period_name ''1500 - 500 BC'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:111547", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s022: period_start ''-1500'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:111548", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s022: site_type ''Cemetery'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:244795", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-02b_fields-wd3-s011: site_type None -> ''Cemetery''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:255023", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s022: period_name None -> ''1500 - 500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:255024", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s022: period_start None -> ''-800''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:387488", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07_mechanical-period-fix-s004: period_name ''1500 - 500 BC'' -> ''Undated''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:387489", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07_mechanical-period-fix-s004: period_start ''-800'' -> None"}]'::jsonb),
