e site is designated as a scheduled monument [1]. The site is at grid reference SU381353, east of the village of Stockbridge [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:112357", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s023: period_name ''1500 - 500 BC'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:112358", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s023: period_start ''-1000'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:167445", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-035: thumbnail_url ''https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/fa/Woolbury_Ring%2C_Stockbridge_Down_-_geograph.org.uk_-_100453.jpg'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/fd7b2e9e/hero.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:255099", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s022: period_name None -> ''1500 - 500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:255100", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s022: period_start None -> ''-800''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:387771", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07_mechanical-period-fix-s005: period_name ''1500 - 500 BC'' -> ''Undated''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:387772", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07_mechanical-period-fix-s005: period_start ''-800'' -> None"}]'::jsonb),
    ('fe268a4c-2d51-42f9-a00e-addd8fe217da'::uuid, 'antiquity', '5', '8', 'card-stats-2026-11-07-rollback:fe268a4c-2d51-42f9-a00e-addd8fe217da:antiquity', 'rollback of card-stats-2026-11-07: antiquity ''8'' restored on The Longstone, Mottistone', '11ce177e36c73a9f01e79852f185b253', '[{"source": "api/cardgame/generator.py:site_card_stats", "url": "api/cardgame/generator.py", "quote": "antiquity = 5 from period_start None"}, {"source": "production export d17040beec27c2c0 (2026-11-07 10:00:39.847916+00)", "url": "remediation_change_log + unified_sites + card_stats (read-only)", "quote": "counterfactual: 900 journalled input value(s) put back reproduce the stored card_stats in all 59700 cells (basis: wave 2026-11-05''s own export (2026-11-05 22:52:16.465314+00))"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:43271", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "phase4:p4-0070:chunk-0001: description ''The Longstone is a megalithic monument near Mottistone on the Isle of Wight, dating to 4500–3000 BC. It is the only megalithic monument on the island. The monument consists of two Greensand Sandstone boulders, the larger standing 3.9 metres (13 ft) tall with the smaller lying at its foot. Located in a fenced enclosure on the edge of a wood off Strawberry Lane, it was designated a scheduled monument in 1981.[1]'' -> ''The Longstone is a megalithic monument near the village of Mottistone, in the civil parish of Brighstone, close to the south west coast of the Isle of Wight [1]. It is the only megalithic monument on the Island [1]. The Longstone consists of two pieces of local greensand sandstone probably from a vein 100 metres away [1]. The larger stands at 3.9 metres and the smaller lies at its foot [1]. The stones are associated with a narrow mound 21 metres long, which runs from them to the west [1]. In September 1956, excavations by C.N. Hawkes appeared to confirm that this was the remains of a long barrow, so that the stones may be the remains of an entrance [1]. Although dating is difficult, pottery excavated in 1956 indicates that the mound (and therefore probably the stones also) are Neolithic [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:126712", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26b_fields-wd1-s011: period_name ''4500 - 3000 BC'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:126713", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26b_fields-wd1-s011: period_start ''-4500'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:126714", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26b_fields-wd1-s011: site_type ''Megalithic stones'' -> ''Standing stone''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:167466", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-035: thumbnail_url ''https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/ec/The_Longstone%2C_Mottistone%2C_IW%2C_UK.jpg'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/fe268a4c/The longstone, Mottistone, Isle of Wight, England (2).webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:255101", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s022: period_name None -> ''4500 - 3000 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:255102", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s022: period_start None -> ''-4000''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:327195", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-06-005-004: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/fe268a4c/The longstone, Mottistone, Isle of Wight, England (2).webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/fe268a4c/The Longstone, Mottistone, IW, UK.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:387773", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07_mechanical-period-fix-s005: period_name ''4500 - 3000 BC'' -> ''Undated''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:387774", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07_mechanical-period-fix-s005: period_start ''-4000'' -> None"}]'::jsonb),
